      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am a bit confused here.\nCan you confirm the following points please ?\n\n1. can you confirm that LE Audio resampling is enabled for CrOS ? The code is under flag and all flags default to false under CrOS build.\n\n2. as I understand it, the clock drift is caused by the difference in time domains between the main SoC and the BT controller. That cannot be fixed by changing the clock domain of the source LE audio timer.",
